This package reproduces results reported in:
  "CAC Plus: An open-source calcium-scoring engine for opportunistic coronary artery
   calcium quantification on non-gated multi-format chest CT" (submitted, 2026; see CITATION.cff).

It wraps, unchanged, the VA AI-CAC algorithm of Hagopian et al.
(github.com/Raffi-Hagopian/AI-CAC, release v1.0.0, MIT License). No invention is claimed
over that algorithm, the Agatston scoring formula (Agatston et al. 1990), or nnU-Net.

No patient images or protected health information are included in this repository.

NLST-derived tables in results_expected/ (de-identified TCIA participant ids, SeriesInstanceUIDs,
acquisition parameters and our scores) are derived from data licensed under CC BY 4.0:
  National Lung Screening Trial Research Team (2013). Data from the National Lung Screening
  Trial (NLST) [Data set]. The Cancer Imaging Archive. https://doi.org/10.7937/TCIA.HMQ8-J677
